---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 sm:py-28 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
  <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
    <!-- Text -->
    <div>
      <p class="section-eyebrow mb-3">Welcome to Palawan</p>
      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-navy mb-6">
        A Waterfront Promenade<br />Like No Other
      </h2>
      <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-sunset rounded-full mb-6"></div>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-navy/80 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          The <strong class="text-navy">Puerto Princesa City Baywalk Park</strong> is the city's beloved waterfront promenade — a vibrant strip where the Sulu Sea breeze meets the rhythm of local life. Stretching along Sandoval Street, this palm-lined esplanade transforms every evening into a celebration of food, music, and sunset colors.
        </p>
        <p>
          As dusk falls, the Baywalk comes alive. Food stalls fire up their grills, serving everything from freshly caught seafood to Filipino street-food classics like <em>isaw</em> and <em>balut</em>. Local musicians strum guitars, families stroll with ice cream in hand, and the sky puts on a spectacular show of orange and pink.
        </p>
        <p>
          Whether you're a photographer chasing the golden hour, a food lover on a culinary adventure, or simply looking for a relaxing evening walk, the Baywalk offers a genuine taste of Puerto Princesa's warm community spirit — all for free.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Highlights Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      {[
        { icon: 'sunset', title: 'Sunset Views', desc: 'World-class sunsets over the Sulu Sea every evening' },
        { icon: 'food', title: 'Food Paradise', desc: 'Fresh seafood, BBQ, and Filipino street-food stalls' },
        { icon: 'music', title: 'Live Music', desc: 'Local bands and acoustic performers set the mood' },
        { icon: 'heart', title: 'Free Entry', desc: 'Open to everyone — no entrance fee, just pure enjoyment' },
      ].map(item => (
        <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-5 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-sunset/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <Icon name={item.icon} size={20} class="text-sunset" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-navy mb-1">{item.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-navy/60">{item.desc}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
